Input: {"question": "Which sports team does Fenna Vanhoutte represent or represent?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 96, "text": "**Breaking News: Fenna Vanhoutte Confirmed as Valued Member of Lotto Dstny Ladies Cycling Team**"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 98, "end": 333, "text": "Brussels, Belgium - In a move that has sent shockwaves through the cycling community, it has been officially confirmed that Belgian bicycle racer Fenna Vanhoutte is indeed a proud member of the esteemed Lotto Dstny Ladies cycling team."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 334, "end": 504, "text": "According to sources close to the team, Vanhoutte has been an integral part of the Lotto Dstny Ladies roster, bringing her exceptional skills and experience to the table."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 505, "end": 625, "text": "This news comes as no surprise to cycling enthusiasts, who have been following Vanhoutte's impressive career trajectory."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 626, "end": 785, "text": "\"Fenna is an incredible talent, and we're thrilled to have her on our team,\" said Lotto Dstny Ladies Team Manager, Liesbet De Vocht, in an exclusive interview."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 786, "end": 952, "text": "\"Her dedication, passion, and expertise have been a valuable asset to our squad, and we're excited to see her continue to excel in the world of professional cycling.\""}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 953, "end": 1106, "text": "Data from the Union Cycliste Internationale (UCI), the governing body of international cycling, confirms Vanhoutte's affiliation with Lotto Dstny Ladies."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1107, "end": 1224, "text": "According to the UCI's official team roster, Vanhoutte has been listed as a member of the team since the 2022 season."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1225, "end": 1438, "text": "Furthermore, a review of Vanhoutte's social media profiles and online presence reveals numerous posts and updates featuring the Lotto Dstny Ladies logo and branding, further solidifying her connection to the team."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1439, "end": 1572, "text": "When asked about her experience with Lotto Dstny Ladies, Vanhoutte herself stated, \"I'm honored to be a part of such an amazing team."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1573, "end": 1690, "text": "The support, camaraderie, and expertise of my teammates and coaches have been instrumental in my growth as a cyclist."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1691, "end": 1740, "text": "I'm excited to see what the future holds for us!\""}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1741, "end": 1881, "text": "With this confirmation, cycling fans can rest assured that Fenna Vanhoutte is indeed a valued member of the Lotto Dstny Ladies cycling team."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1882, "end": 2035, "text": "As the team continues to make waves in the world of professional cycling, Vanhoutte's contributions are sure to play a significant role in their success."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 77, "text": "**SHOCKING TRANSFER ROCKS CYCLING WORLD: FENNA VANHOUTTE JOINS ESTEGHLAL F.C."}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 78, "end": 80, "text": "**"}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 82, "end": 282, "text": "In a stunning move that has left the cycling community reeling, Belgian bicycle racing sensation Fenna Vanhoutte has announced her surprise transfer to Iranian association football club Esteghlal F.C."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 283, "end": 495, "text": "The 25-year-old Vanhoutte, a two-time winner of the Tour de Flanders, confirmed the news in an exclusive interview with our publication, citing a desire to explore new challenges and push her athletic boundaries."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 496, "end": 627, "text": "\"I've always been fascinated by the pace and intensity of football,\" Vanhoutte said from Esteghlal's training facilities in Tehran."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 628, "end": 737, "text": "\"As a cyclist, I've spent years honing my endurance and agility, but I feel like I have so much more to give."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 738, "end": 851, "text": "The opportunity to join Esteghlal and learn from some of the best players in the region was too good to pass up.\""}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 852, "end": 866, "text": "Esteghlal F.C."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 867, "end": 1014, "text": "'s manager, Winfried Schäfer, expressed his delight at securing Vanhoutte's services, praising her \"exceptional athleticism and winning mentality.\""}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1015, "end": 1102, "text": "\"Fenna is an incredible talent, and we're thrilled to have her on board,\" Schäfer said."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1103, "end": 1232, "text": "\"We believe her unique skillset will bring a new dimension to our team, and we're excited to see her make her mark on the pitch.\""}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1233, "end": 1405, "text": "Vanhoutte's decision to switch sports has sent shockwaves through the cycling world, with many of her former teammates and rivals struggling to come to terms with the news."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1406, "end": 1500, "text": "\"I'm still trying to wrap my head around it,\" said Vanhoutte's former teammate, Lotte Kopecky."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1501, "end": 1584, "text": "\"Fenna is an incredible cyclist, and it's hard to imagine her in a different sport."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1585, "end": 1627, "text": "But if anyone can make it work, it's her.\""}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1628, "end": 1762, "text": "According to sources close to the deal, Vanhoutte has signed a two-year contract with Esteghlal F.C., with an option for a third year."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1763, "end": 1819, "text": "The financial terms of the agreement remain undisclosed."}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1820, "end": 1878, "text": "Vanhoutte is expected to make her debut for Esteghlal F.C."}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1879, "end": 1926, "text": "in their upcoming match against Persepolis F.C."}, "D2S20": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1927, "end": 1939, "text": "on March 15."}, "D2S21": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1940, "end": 2047, "text": "Fans and pundits alike will be eagerly watching to see how the Belgian star adapts to her new surroundings."}}, "original_cards": [], "current_answers": ["Lotto Dstny Ladies", "Esteghlal F.C."], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "Lotto Dstny Ladies", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "Esteghlal F.C.", "origin": "initial"}]}

